export anchor JazzClubStyle:
    number: 276
    screen: CloudFiles
    name: Jazz club
    idea: A late night lounge where one blue spotlight falls on a numbered set list of files, brass trim and a deep red velvet card hold the details, and titles sing in italic serif.
    base: dark
    palette:
        midnight: #0a1120, the page and fields
        navy: #121b30, search, switch, the gauge card and the style sheet
        smoke: #1a2540, the pressed switch segment
        spotlight: #5082dc, the spotlight cone at 42 percent alpha and the selected row tint
        ink: #f3ecdf, warm cream text
        muted: #b7bdcc, meta and labels
        line: #2c3856, row rules and borders
        brass: #d9ad5b, numerals, the primary button with dark text #1c1306, Starred, the current nav and the gauge
        velvet: #561322, the details card
        velvetInk: #f1dcd8, text on velvet
        blue: #9cc8ff, Shared, Selected and focus
        rose: #ffa8a0, Uploading and its groove
    type:
        Titles and file names in Palatino Linotype, Book Antiqua, Georgia.
        The folder title is 52px italic at 400 weight, the list heading
        26px italic, file names 19px roman. Body in Optima, Candara, Segoe
        UI at 15px with 1.55 line height. Nav in 16px small caps, small
        labels 12px caps tracked 0.4em in brass.
    layout:
        A centred stage under a blue spotlight cone falling from the top
        centre, with faint smoke drifts, all clipped by its section. The
        header is centred, a brass line Brightwork Drive and Fernhill
        Studio, the italic title Website redesign, a breadcrumb with
        floral separators, then the five drive links in one centred small
        caps row between brass hairlines, My files underlined in brass.
        Below, a two column stage. The left column has a pill Search
        files, Upload, New folder and a pill List or Grid switch, then the
        heading Tonight's files with 8 in this folder, then an ordered set
        list. Each file gets a brass italic Roman numeral, a type icon, the
        name, a dotted leader and the size, then a second line of kind,
        date and person and any status. The selected row is a rounded blue
        tinted band with a thin blue outline. Uploading adds a rose groove
        bar. A gauge card follows with a brass half dial and 64.2 GB of
        100 GB used. On the right a 330px velvet card with an 18px radius,
        a brass frame and an inner hairline holds Details, the preview,
        the italic name, Starred, small caps facts aligned right, and a
        full width Share over Download and Get link. Below 980px the card
        moves under the list.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 40px between list and card, 14px row padding, 32px gutters.
    density: Relaxed. Each file takes two lines.
    corners: Pills for buttons, search and switch. An 18px velvet card with a 12px inner frame. The selected band is 12px.
    borders: 1px navy rules between rows. Brass hairlines frame the nav and make the double frame on the card.
    shadows: A long soft drop under the velvet card and a brass glow under the primary button.
    icons:
        1.5px line icons in brass. Status is a coloured semibold word with
        a star for Starred, two heads for Shared, an up arrow for Uploading
        and a checked box for Selected.
    focus: A 2px pale blue outline offset 3px with a faint blue halo.
    tone: Warm and a little theatrical, such as Tonight's files and 8 in this folder.
